OL,3,GNEWSARunning group for teen girls gets
OL,4,Asecond location
OL,5,
OL,6,FA running group supporting teenage
OL,7,Fgirls is expanding its programme with a
OL,8,Fnew location.
OL,10,FSee Her Run, a Jersey-based group set
OL,11,Fup for girls in school years 9 to 13,
OL,12,Fwill now host its Thursday sessions
OL,13,Ffrom Les Quennevais Sports Centre.
OL,15,FOrganisers said the twice-weekly group,
OL,16,Fwhich launched in 2024, would also
OL,17,Fcontinue to run its Tuesday sessions
OL,18,Fform the Sail Statue near the Radisson
OL,19,FBlu in St Helier.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
