OL,3,GNEWSARunning group for teen girls gets
OL,4,Asecond location
OL,5,
OL,6,FFounder and chairwoman Ceri Tinley said
OL,7,Fthe run was "safe and supportive" and
OL,8,Fits new location would allow girls who
OL,9,Flive in the west of the island to have
OL,10,Feasy access to join.
